Hypothesis PCLONE : pixClone_cpsF RT.
Hypothesis PAMB : pixAddMirroredBorder_cps2 RT.
Hypothesis PGEV : pixGetExtremeValue_cps RT.
Hypothesis PDRC : pixDestroy_rc_cpsF RT.
